msgid "Our plugins"
msgstr "Ár mbreiseáin"

msgid "Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Breiseáin Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Generous, privacy-first WordPress plugins — built in Denmark. Free cores, no"
" credits, your data stays on your site."
msgstr ""
"Breiseáin WordPress fhlaithiúla, príobháideachas ar dtús — déanta sa "
"Danmhairg. Croíleacáin saor in aisce, gan chreidmheasanna, fanann do shonraí"
" ar do shuíomh."

msgid "More from Lynbro"
msgstr "Tuilleadh ó Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Our growing suite of free, privacy-first plugins. Already-installed ones are"
" marked."
msgstr ""
"Ár raon méadaithe de bhreiseáin saor in aisce, príobháideachas ar dtús. "
"Marcáiltear na cinn atá suiteáilte cheana."

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Suiteáilte"

msgid "On WordPress.org"
msgstr "Ar WordPress.org"

msgid "Coming soon"
msgstr "Ag teacht go luath"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "Suiteáil"

msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Tuilleadh eolais"

msgid "About Lynbro"
msgstr "Maidir le Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Lynbro builds genuinely free, privacy-first WordPress plugins with generous "
"free cores — no credits, no paywalls on the essentials, your data on your "
"own site. Made in Denmark."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn Lynbro breiseáin WordPress atá fíor-saor in aisce, "
"príobháideachas ar dtús, le croíleacáin fhlaithiúla saor in aisce — gan "
"chreidmheasanna, gan bhallaí íocaíochta do na bunriachtanais, do shonraí ar "
"do shuíomh féin. Déanta sa Danmhairg."

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Tabhair cuairt ar Lynbro"

msgid "Suggest a feature or report a bug"
msgstr "Mol gné nó tuairiscigh fabht"

msgid ""
"Feedback opens our public roadmap on plugins.lynbro.dk in a new tab — "
"nothing is sent from your site."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn aiseolas ár mbóthar poiblí ar plugins.lynbro.dk i gcluaisín nua — "
"ní sheoltar faic ó do shuíomh."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Uirlisí"

msgid ""
"Export this plugin&#8217;s settings as a JSON backup, or reset them to "
"defaults. 100% local — nothing leaves your site."
msgstr ""
"Easpórtáil socruithe an bhreiseáin seo mar chúltaca JSON, nó athshocraigh "
"iad go dtí na réamhshocruithe. 100% áitiúil — ní fhágann faic do shuíomh."

msgid "Export settings (JSON)"
msgstr "Easpórtáil socruithe (JSON)"

msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Athshocraigh go dtí na réamhshocruithe"

msgid "About Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Faochán faoi Lynbro SMTP"

msgid ""
"WordPress sends email with PHP mail() by default, which inboxes treat as "
"suspicious. Lynbro SMTP sends it through a real, authenticated mail server "
"instead — the one of your host, your mailbox or a sending service — so "
"password resets, orders and contact forms arrive."
msgstr ""
"Seolann WordPress ríomhphost le PHP mail() de réir réamhshocraithe, rud a "
"mheasann boscaí isteach mar amhrasach. Seolann Lynbro SMTP é trí fhreastalaí"
" ríomhphoist fíoraithe, údaraithe ina ionad sin — freastalaí do óstach, do "
"bhosca poist nó seirbhís seolta — ionas go dtiocfaidh athshocruithe "
"pasfhocail, orduithe agus foirmeacha teagmhála isteach."

msgid ""
"Everything is in the free plugin: the log, resend, the backup connection, "
"alerts, diagnostics and WP-CLI. There is no paid version."
msgstr ""
"Tá gach rud sa bhreiseán saor in aisce: an logáil, athsheoladh, an nasc "
"cúltaca, foláirimh, diagnóisic agus WP-CLI. Níl leagan íoctha ann."

msgid "How your data is handled"
msgstr "Conas a láimhseáiltear do chuid sonraí"

msgid ""
"Email goes straight from your server to the SMTP server you set. The plugin "
"contacts no Lynbro service and sends no statistics anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Téann an ríomhphost díreach ó do fhreastalaí chuig an bhfreastalaí SMTP a "
"shocraíonn tú. Ní dhéanann an breiseán teagmháil le seirbhís Lynbro ar bith "
"agus ní sheolann sé aon staitisticí áit ar bith."

msgid ""
"The SMTP password is encrypted with your site's security keys, never shown "
"again and never written to the log or the settings export."
msgstr ""
"Déantar pasfhocal SMTP a chriptiú le heochracha slándála do shuímh, ní "
"thaispeántar arís é riamh agus ní scríobhtar chuig an logáil ná chuig an "
"easpórtáil socruithe é."

msgid ""
"The log keeps recipients, subject and status in your own database. Message "
"content only for failed emails by default, and every entry is deleted after "
"the retention period."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn an logáil faighteoirí, ábhar agus stádas i do bhunachar sonraí "
"féin. Ábhar teachtaireachta amháin do ríomhphoist theipthe de réir "
"réamhshocraithe, agus scriostar gach iontráil tar éis na tréimhse coinneála."

msgid ""
"Log entries are included in Tools → Export Personal Data and Erase Personal "
"Data."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear iontrálacha loga san áireamh in Uirlisí → Easpórtáil Sonraí "
"Pearsanta agus Scrios Sonraí Pearsanta."

msgid ""
"A failure webhook, if you set one, receives only the error text and a link "
"to your log."
msgstr ""
"Faigheann gréasáinchúlfhilleadh teipe, má shocraíonn tú ceann, an téacs "
"earráide amháin agus nasc chuig do logáil."

msgid "Keep the login in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Coinnigh an logáil isteach i wp-config.php"

msgid ""
"Any of these constants overrides the field in Settings, and the value never "
"reaches the database or its backups:"
msgstr ""
"Sáraíonn aon cheann de na constants seo an réimse i Socruithe, agus ní "
"shroicheann an luach an bunachar sonraí ná a chúltacaí riamh:"

msgid "WP-CLI"
msgstr "WP-CLI"

msgid "Version & links"
msgstr "Leagan & naisc"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Leagan"

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Leathanach baile an bhreiseáin"

msgid "Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbro"

msgid "Send a test email"
msgstr "Seol ríomhphost tástála"

msgid ""
"No SMTP server is set yet, so the test goes out with PHP mail(). Fill in "
"Settings first to test SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon fhreastalaí SMTP socraithe fós, mar sin seoltar an tástáil le PHP "
"mail(). Líon isteach Socruithe ar dtús chun SMTP a thástáil."

msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "Faighteoir"

msgid "Test the backup connection"
msgstr "Tástáil an nasc cúltaca"

msgid "SMTP conversation (password hidden)"
msgstr "Comhrá SMTP (pasfhocal folaithe)"

msgid ""
"Test emails ignore test mode and \"do not send\" mode, so you can check the "
"connection on a staging copy."
msgstr ""
"Ní thugann ríomhphoist tástála aird ar mhód tástála ná ar mhód \"ná seol\", "
"ionas gur féidir leat an nasc a sheiceáil ar chóip stáitsiúcháin."

msgid "Can this server reach the SMTP server?"
msgstr "An féidir leis an bhfreastalaí seo teacht ar an bhfreastalaí SMTP?"

msgid ""
"Many hosts block outgoing mail ports. This checks the usual ones to your "
"saved host, from this web server."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann go leor óstach bac ar phoirt ríomhphoist amach. Seiceálann sé seo "
"na cinn is gnách chuig do óstaigh sábháilte, ón bhfreastalaíéasáin seo."

msgid "Check ports"
msgstr "Seiceáil poirt"

msgid "Sender domain: %s"
msgstr "Fearann an tseoltóra: %s"

msgid "DNS lookups are not available on this server."
msgstr "Níl cuardaigh DNS ar fáil ar an bhfreastalaí seo."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes your SMTP provider (for example "
"include:spf.brevo.com)."
msgstr ""
"Cinntigh go n-áirítear do sholáthraí SMTP ann (mar shampla "
"include:spf.brevo.com)."

msgid ""
"No SPF record. Add one at your DNS host that names your SMTP provider, or "
"many inboxes will distrust the email."
msgstr ""
"Níl taifead SPF ann. Cuir ceann leis ag d’óstach DNS a ainmníonn do "
"sholáthraí SMTP, nó beidh amhras ar go leor boscaí isteach faoin ríomhphost."

msgid ""
"No DMARC record. Gmail and Yahoo require one for bulk senders; even a simple"
" \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" helps."
msgstr ""
"Níl taifead DMARC ann. Éilíonn Gmail agus Yahoo ceann do sheoltóirí "
"mórchóir; cabhraíonn fiú \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" simplí."

msgid ""
"DKIM is set up at your SMTP provider (they give you the DNS record). It "
"cannot be checked from here without the selector name."
msgstr ""
"Socraítear DKIM ag do sholáthraí SMTP (tugann siad an taifead DNS duit). Ní "
"féidir é a sheiceáil as seo gan ainm an roghnóra."

