msgstr "(gan ábhar)"

msgid "Attachments (not kept): %s"
msgstr "Ceangaltáin (ní choinnítear): %s"

msgid "Resend of entry #%d"
msgstr "Athsheoladh iontrála #%d"

msgid "Content not kept."
msgstr "Ní choinnítear an t-ábhar."

msgid "Resend"
msgstr "Athsheol"

msgid "Delete the selected entries?"
msgstr "An dteastaíonn uait na hiontrálacha roghnaithe a scriosadh?"

msgid "Delete selected"
msgstr "Scrios roghnaithe"

msgid "%1$s entries · deleted automatically after %2$s days"
msgstr "%1$s iontráil · scriostar go huathoibríoch tar éis %2$s lá"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Ag seiceáil…"

msgid "Sent. Check the inbox (and the spam folder) of the recipient."
msgstr ""
"Seolta. Seiceáil bosca isteach (agus fillteán an turscair) an fhaighteora."

msgid "Not sent."
msgstr "Níor seoladh."

msgid "open"
msgstr "oscailte"

msgid "blocked"
msgstr "blocáilte"

msgid "Request failed:"
msgstr "Theip ar iarratas:"

msgid "Delivered through:"
msgstr "Seachadta trí:"

msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr "Níl ceadúnas leordhóthanach agat chun an leathanach seo a rochtain."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Socruithe"

msgid "Test & diagnostics"
msgstr "Tástáil & diagnóisic"

msgid "Email log"
msgstr "Logáil ríomhphoist"

msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Aiseolas"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Maidir le"

msgid ""
"Send every WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log,"
" resend, a backup connection and failure alerts. All free, no upsells."
msgstr ""
"Seol gach ríomhphost WordPress trí do fhreastalaí SMTP féin — le logáil "
"ríomhphoist, athsheoladh, nasc cúltaca agus foláirimh teipe. Go léir saor in"
" aisce, gan aon upsell."

msgid "The email was sent again."
msgstr "Seoladh an ríomhphost arís."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again — see the newest log entry for the reason."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an ríomhphost a sheoladh arís — féach an iontráil logála is "
"déanaí chun an chúis a fháil."

msgid "The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent."
msgstr ""
"Níor coinníodh ábhar an ríomhphoist seo, mar sin ní féidir é a athsheoladh."

msgid "Log entries deleted."
msgstr "Scriosadh iontrálacha logála."

msgid ""
"Settings imported. Enter the SMTP password once and save — passwords are "
"never copied from other plugins."
msgstr ""
"Iompórtáladh socruithe. Cuir an focal faire SMTP isteach uair amháin agus "
"sábháil — ní chóipeáiltear focail faire ó phlugáin eile riamh."

msgid "Set in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Socraithe i wp-config.php"

msgid "Email is sent through %1$s on port %2$s."
msgstr "Seoltar an ríomhphost trí %1$s ar chalafort %2$s."

msgid ""
"No SMTP server set yet — WordPress still sends with PHP mail(). Pick your "
"provider below, fill in the login and save."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon fhreastalaí SMTP socraithe fós — seolann WordPress fós le PHP "
"mail(). Roghnaigh do sholáthraí thíos, líon isteach an logáil isteach agus "
"sábháil."

msgid "Delivery is switched off: emails are logged but not sent."
msgstr ""
"Tá an seachadadh múchta: déantar na ríomhphoist a logáil ach ní sheoltar "
"iad."

msgid "Test mode: every email goes to %s instead of its recipients."
msgstr "Mód tástála: téann gach ríomhphost chuig %s in ionad a bhfaighteoirí."

msgid ""
"The saved password can no longer be read because the site's security keys "
"changed. Enter it again and save."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir an focal faire sábháilte a léamh a thuilleadh mar gur athraigh "
"eochracha slándála an tsuímh. Cuir isteach arís é agus sábháil."

msgid "Last failure %1$s ago: %2$s"
msgstr "An teip is déanaí %1$s ó shin: %2$s"

msgid "Show failed emails"
msgstr "Taispeáin ríomhphoist theipthe"

msgid ""
"Also active: %s. Two mail plugins fight over the same email — deactivate the"
" other one."
msgstr ""
"Gníomhach freisin: %s. Bíonn dhá phlugán ríomhphoist ag troid faoin "
"ríomhphost céanna — díghníomhachtaigh an ceann eile."

msgid "Import settings from %s"
msgstr "Iompórtáil socruithe ó %s"

msgid "SMTP server"
msgstr "Freastalaí SMTP"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Soláthraí"

msgid "Port and encryption"
msgstr "Port agus criptiú"

msgid "TLS (STARTTLS) — usually port 587"
msgstr "TLS (STARTTLS) — port 587 de ghnáth"

msgid "SSL — usually port 465"
msgstr "SSL — port 465 de ghnáth"

msgid "None — only for a server on the same network"
msgstr "Ar bith — don fhreastalaí ar an líonra céanna amháin"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Fíordheimhniú"

msgid "The server needs a username and password (almost always)"
msgstr ""
"Tá ainm úsáideora agus focal faire de dhíth ar an bhfreastalaí (beagnach i "
"gcónaí)"

msgid ""
"The password comes from LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS in wp-config.php and is not stored "
"in the database."
msgstr ""
"Tagann an focal faire ó LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS i wp-config.php agus ní stóráiltear"
" sa bhunachar sonraí é."

msgid "Saved — leave empty to keep it"
msgstr "Sábháilte — fág folamh chun é a choinneáil"

msgid "Remove the saved password"
msgstr "Bain an focal faire sábháilte"

msgid ""
"Stored encrypted with your site's security keys and never shown again. To "
"keep it out of the database entirely, define it in wp-config.php (see "
"About)."
msgstr ""
"Stóráilte go cripteáilte le heochracha slándála do shuímh agus ní "
"thaispeántar arís é. Chun é a choinneáil amach as an mbunachar sonraí go "
"hiomlán, sainigh é i wp-config.php (féach Maidir le)."

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "Teastas"

msgid "Verify the server certificate"
msgstr "Fíoraigh teastas an fhreastalaí"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Réamhshocrú"

msgid "Untick only for your own server with a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Díthiceáil ach amháin do do fhreastalaí féin le teastas féinshínithe."

msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Seoltóir"

msgid "Force this address on every email, whatever other plugins set"
msgstr ""
"Cuir an seoladh seo i bhfeidhm ar gach ríomhphost, pé socrú a dhéanann "
"breiseáin eile"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Moltar"

msgid ""
"Use an address on a domain your SMTP account may send for, or providers "
"reject or spam-folder the email."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid seoladh ar fhearann a bhféadfaidh do chuntas SMTP ríomhphost a "
"sheoladh uaidh, nó diúltóidh soláthraithe don ríomhphost nó cuirfidh siad i "
"bhfillteán turscair é."

msgid "Force this name too (off: forms and shops keep their own sender name)"
msgstr ""
"Cuir an t-ainm seo i bhfeidhm freisin (as: coimeádann foirmeacha agus siopaí"
" a n-ainm seoltóra féin)"

msgid "Default Reply-To"
msgstr "Réamhshocraithe Reply-To"

msgid ""
"Used only when an email has no Reply-To of its own, so contact-form replies "
"still go to the visitor."
msgstr ""
"Ní úsáidtear é ach nuair nach bhfuil Reply-To dá chuid féin ag ríomhphost, "
"ionas go dtéann freagraí ar fhoirm teagmhála chuig an gcuairteoir fós."

msgid "Return-Path"
msgstr "Return-Path"

msgid "Send bounces to the From address"
msgstr "Seol preabtha chuig an seoladh From"

msgid "Backup connection"
msgstr "Ceangal cúltaca"

msgid ""
"When the main server fails, the same email is sent again through the backup "
"at once — the visitor never sees an error."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a theipeann ar an bpríomhfhreastalaí, seoltar an ríomhphost céanna "
"arís láithreach tríd an gcúltaca — ní fheiceann an cuairteoir aon earráid."

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Cúltaca"

msgid "Use a backup when the main server fails"
msgstr "Úsáid cúltaca nuair a theipeann ar an bpríomhfhreastalaí"

msgid "Another SMTP server"
msgstr "Fhreastalaí SMTP eile"

msgid "PHP mail() of this server (better than nothing; may land in spam)"
msgstr ""
"PHP mail() an fhreastalaí seo (níos fearr ná faic; d’fhéadfadh sé dul i "
"dturscar)"

msgid "Backup host"
msgstr "Óstach cúltaca"

msgid "Backup port"
msgstr "Port cúltaca"

msgid "Backup encryption"
msgstr "Criptiú cúltaca"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Dada"

msgid "Backup login"
msgstr "Logáil isteach cúltaca"

msgid "Backup password"
msgstr "Pasfhocal cúltaca"

msgid "Delivery mode"
msgstr "Mód seachadta"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mód"

msgid "Send normally"
msgstr "Seol go gnáth"

msgid "Test mode: send everything to one address (Cc and Bcc are dropped)"
msgstr ""
"Mód tástála: seol gach rud chuig seoladh amháin (caitear Cc agus Bcc ar "
"shiúl)"

msgid "Redirect address"
msgstr "Seoladh atreoraithe"

msgid "Do not send any email (staging copies) — emails are still logged"
msgstr ""
"Ná seol aon ríomhphost (cóipeanna stáitsiú) — logáiltear na ríomhphoist fós"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "Logáil"

msgid "Keep a log of every email (recipient, subject, status, error)"
msgstr "Coinnigh log de gach ríomhphost (faighteoir, ábhar, stádas, earráid)"

msgid "Keep message content"
msgstr "Ábhar na teachtaireachta a choinneáil"

msgid "Only of failed emails, so they can be resent"
msgstr "De ríomhphoist theipthe amháin, ionas gur féidir iad a sheoladh arís"

msgid ""
"Of every email (lets you resend anything; the log then holds password-reset "
"links and order details)"
msgstr ""
"De gach ríomhphost (ligeann sé duit aon rud a sheoladh arís; ansin beidh "
"naisc athshocraithe pasfhocail agus sonraí ordaithe sa log)"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "Ná riamh"

msgid "Keep entries for"
msgstr "Coinnigh taifid ar feadh"

msgid "days, then they are deleted automatically"
msgstr "lá, ansin scriostar go huathoibríoch iad"

msgid "Failure alerts"
msgstr "Foláirimh theipe"

msgid ""
"At most one alert per hour. The alert email is sent with PHP mail() of this "
"server, because the SMTP server may be the thing that is down."
msgstr ""
"Ar a mhéad foláireamh amháin san uair. Seoltar an ríomhphost foláirimh le "
"PHP mail() an fhreastalaí seo, toisc go bhféadfadh an freastalaí SMTP a "
"bheith ar lár."

msgid "Alert email"
msgstr "Ríomhphost foláirimh"

msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "URL Webhook"

msgid ""
"Optional. Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams workflows, ntfy or your own "
"endpoint (HTTPS). The plugin posts the error text there — nothing else, and "
"only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Roghnach. Sreafaí oibre Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams, ntfy nó do "
"chríochphointe féin (HTTPS). Seolann an breiseán téacs na hearráide ansin — "
"rud ar bith eile, agus ní nuair a shocraíonn tú URL amháin."

msgid "Import from another SMTP plugin"
msgstr "Iompórtáil ó phlugán SMTP eile"

msgid ""
"Copies host, port, encryption, username and sender. Passwords stay where "
"they are — enter yours once after importing."
msgstr ""
"Cóipeálann sé an óstach, an port, an criptiú, an t-ainm úsáideora agus an "
"seoltóir. Fanann na pasfhocail san áit ina bhfuil siad — cuir do chuid féin "
"isteach uair amháin tar éis iompórtála."

msgid "Import from %s"
msgstr "Iompórtáil ó %s"

msgid ""
"No settings of WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP or Post SMTP were "
"found on this site."
msgstr ""
"Níor aimsíodh aon socruithe de WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP ná "
"Post SMTP ar an suíomh seo."

msgid "Download the log (CSV)"
msgstr "Íoslódáil an logáil (CSV)"

msgid "Delete every log entry?"
msgstr "Scrios gach iontráil sa logáil?"

msgid "Empty the log"
msgstr "Folmhaigh an logáil"

msgid "Is it working for you?"
msgstr "An bhfuil sé ag obair duit?"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is free, with nothing locked. If it got your email delivered, a "
"short review helps other people find it."
msgstr ""
"Tá Lynbro SMTP saor in aisce, gan aon rud glasáilte. Má chabhraigh sé le do "
"ríomhphost a sheachadadh, cabhróidh léirmheas gairid le daoine eile é a "
"aimsiú."

msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Fág léirmheas ar WordPress.org"

msgid "Something missing or broken?"
msgstr "Tá rud éigin in easnamh nó briste?"

msgid ""
"Bug reports and ideas are read by the people who build the plugin. Opening "
"these links sends nothing from your site."
msgstr ""
"Léann na daoine a thógann an breiseán tuairiscí fabhtanna agus smaointe. Ní "
"sheoltar aon rud ó do shuíomh trí na naisc seo a oscailt."

msgid "Ask in the support forum"
msgstr "Fiafraigh sa fhóram tacaíochta"

msgid "Suggest a feature (public roadmap)"
msgstr "Mol gné (plean poiblí bóthair)"

msgid ""
"Posting a log line? Remove addresses first — the Test tab already hides the "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Ag postáil líne logála? Bain seoltaí ar dtús — folaíonn an cluaisín Tástála "
"an pasfhocal cheana féin."

msgid "You do not have permission to do that."
msgstr "Níl cead agat é sin a dhéanamh."

msgid "Enter a valid recipient address."
msgstr "Cuir seoladh glactha bailí isteach."

msgid ""
"%1$s: the main SMTP connection failed and the backup delivered the email. "
"Error: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$s: theip ar an bpríomhcheangal SMTP agus sheachaid an cúltaca an "
"ríomhphost. Earráid: %2$s"

msgid "%1$s: an email could not be sent. Error: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s: níorbh fhéidir ríomhphost a sheoladh. Earráid: %2$s"

msgid "Log entry #%d"
msgstr "Iontráil logála #%d"

msgid "[%s] Email delivery problem"
msgstr "[%s] Fadhb le seachadadh ríomhphoist"

msgid "Email delivery"
msgstr "Seachadadh ríomhphoist"

msgid "Email is sent through SMTP"
msgstr "Seoltar ríomhphost trí SMTP"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Ríomhphost"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends this site's email through an authenticated SMTP server."
msgstr ""
"Seolann Lynbro SMTP ríomhphost an tsuímh seo trí fhreastalaí SMTP "
"fíordheimhnithe."

msgid "Open Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Oscail Lynbro SMTP"

msgid "Email is sent with PHP mail(), not SMTP"
msgstr "Seoltar ríomhphost le PHP mail(), ní le SMTP"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is active but no SMTP server is set, so email still leaves "
"through PHP mail() and often lands in spam."
msgstr ""
"Tá Lynbro SMTP gníomhach ach níl freastalaí SMTP socraithe, mar sin fágann "
"an ríomhphost fós trí PHP mail() agus is minic a chríochnaíonn sé i "
"dturscar."

msgid "The saved SMTP password can no longer be read"
msgstr "Ní féidir an pasfhocal SMTP sábháilte a léamh a thuilleadh"

msgid ""
"The site's security keys changed after the password was saved. Enter the "
"SMTP password again."
msgstr ""
"D'athraigh eochracha slándála an tsuímh tar éis an pasfhocal a shábháil. "
"Cuir pasfhocal SMTP isteach arís."

msgid "Emails failed to send in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Theip ar ríomhphoist a sheoladh le 24 uair an chloig anuas"

msgid "The main SMTP connection failed in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Theip ar an bpríomhcheangal SMTP le 24 uair an chloig anuas"

msgid "Email delivery (7 days)"
msgstr "Seachadadh ríomhphoist (7 lá)"

msgid "Sent: %1$s · Failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Seolta: %1$s · Theip: %2$s"

msgid "No SMTP server is set yet — email is sent with PHP mail()."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon fhreastalaí SMTP socraithe fós — seoltar ríomhphost le PHP mail()."

msgid "Show failed"
msgstr "Taispeáin ar theip"

msgid "Main connection: %1$s — Backup connection: %2$s"
msgstr "Príomhcheangal: %1$s — Cúltaca: %2$s"

msgid "Test email from %s"
msgstr "Ríomhphost tástála ó %s"

msgid ""
"This is a test email from %1$s, sent by Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can read it, email delivery works.\n"
"\n"
"Sent: %2$s\n"
"Connection: %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Seo ríomhphost tástála ó %1$s, seolta ag Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"Má tá tú in ann é a léamh, tá seachadadh ríomhphoist ag obair.\n"
"\n"
"Seolta: %2$s\n"
"Ceangal: %3$s"

msgid "backup"
msgstr "cúltaca"

msgid "main"
msgstr "príomhúil"

msgid ""
"The server refused the username or password. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho and iCloud"
" need an app password, not the normal one; SendGrid and Brevo need an "
"SMTP/API key."
msgstr ""
"Dhiúltaigh an freastalaí don ainm úsáideora nó don phasfhocal. Teastaíonn "
"pasfhocal aip ó Gmail, Outlook, Zoho agus iCloud, ní an gnáthcheann; "
"teastaíonn SMTP/eochair API ó SendGrid agus Brevo."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 has SMTP sign-in switched off for this mailbox. An "
"administrator can enable \"Authenticated SMTP\" for it, or use a relay "
"service instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá síniú isteach SMTP i Microsoft 365 múchta don bhosca poist seo. Is féidir"
" le riarthóir \"Authenticated SMTP\" a chumasú dó, nó seirbhís sealaíochta a"
" úsáid ina ionad."

msgid ""
"The server could not be reached. Many hosts block outgoing ports 25, 465 and"
" 587 — run the port check below, then ask your host to open the port or use "
"the one that is open."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir teagmháil a dhéanamh leis an bhfreastalaí. Cuireann go leor "
"óstach bac ar chalafoirt amach 25, 465 agus 587 — rith an seiceáil calafoirt"
" thíos, ansin iarr ar d’óstach an calafort a oscailt nó an ceann atá "
"oscailte a úsáid."

msgid ""
"The secure connection failed. Check that port and encryption match (587 = "
"TLS, 465 = SSL). If the server uses a self-signed certificate, untick "
"\"Verify the server certificate\"."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar an nasc slán. Seiceáil go n-oireann an calafort agus an criptiú dá "
"chéile (587 = TLS, 465 = SSL). Má tá teastas féinsínithe á úsáid ag an "
"bhfreastalaí, díthiceáil \"Verify the server certificate\"."

msgid ""
"The server does not let this account send as the From address. Use an "
"address on a domain the account owns, and switch on \"Force From email\"."
msgstr ""
"Ní ligeann an freastalaí don chuntas seo seoladh mar an seoladh From. Úsáid "
"seoladh ar fhearann atá ag an gcuntas, agus cuir \"Force From email\" ar "
"siúl."

msgid "The host name does not resolve. Check it for typos."
msgstr "Ní réitíonn an t-ainm ósta. Seiceáil le haghaidh botúin chló."

msgid ""
"Read the last SERVER lines of the transcript: the server usually says "
"exactly what it did not like."
msgstr ""
"Léigh na línte SERVER deireanacha sa tras-scríbhinn: de ghnáth deir an "
"freastalaí go díreach cad nár thaitin leis."

msgid "No host set."
msgstr "Níl aon óstach socraithe."

msgid "That log entry no longer exists."
msgstr "Níl an iontráil loga sin ann a thuilleadh."

msgid ""
"The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent. Change "
"\"Keep message content\" in Settings to resend future emails."
msgstr ""
"Níor coinníodh ábhar na ríomhphoist seo, mar sin ní féidir í a sheoladh "
"arís. Athraigh \"Keep message content\" i Socruithe chun ríomhphoist amach "
"anseo a sheoladh arís."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again. The new attempt and its error are in the "
"log."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an ríomhphost a sheoladh arís. Tá an iarracht nua agus an "
"earráid inti sa log."

msgid "Date (UTC)"
msgstr "Dáta (UTC)"

msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Faighteoirí"

msgid "Lynbro SMTP email log"
msgstr "Lynbro log ríomhphoist SMTP"

msgid ""
"The rest of the suite. What is already on this site is marked; nothing "
"installs without you asking for it."
msgstr ""
"An chuid eile den tsraith. Marcáiltear an méid atá ar an suíomh cheana féin;"
" ní shuiteáiltear faic gan d’iarratas."

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Gníomhach"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "Gníomhachtaigh"

msgid "Install now"
msgstr "Suiteáil anois"

msgid "View on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Féach ar WordPress.org"

msgid ""
"Shared Lynbro components v%1$s, provided by %2$s (newest of %3$d versions on"
" this site)."
msgstr ""
"Comhpháirteanna comhroinnte Lynbro v%1$s, curtha ar fáil ag %2$s (is nuaí de"
" %3$d leagan ar an suíomh seo)."

msgid "Reset all settings to defaults?"
msgstr "Athshocraigh gach socrú go dtí na réamhshocruithe?"

msgid ""
"Is Lynbro SMTP getting your email delivered? A few words on WordPress.org "
"help others find a mail plugin without upsells."
msgstr ""
"An bhfuil Lynbro SMTP ag tabhairt do ríomhphoist slán? Cabhróidh cúpla focal"
" ar WordPress.org le daoine eile breiseán ríomhphoist a aimsiú gan "
"díolacháin bhreise."

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Scríobh léirmheas"

msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Níl, go raibh maith agat"

msgid ""
"Redirect mode needs an address to redirect to — mail is sent normally until "
"you add one."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn seoladh chun athsheoladh uaidh sa mhód atreoraithe — seolfar an "
"ríomhphost de ghnáth go dtí go gcuirfidh tú ceann leis."

msgid "Other SMTP server"
msgstr "Freastalaí SMTP eile"

msgid "Use the SMTP details from your host or email provider."
msgstr "Úsáid na sonraí SMTP ó d’óstach nó ó do sholáthraí ríomhphoist."

msgid ""
"Username: your full Gmail address. Password: an app password (Google Account"
" → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords), not your normal "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Ainm úsáideora: do sheoladh Gmail iomlán. Pasfhocal: pasfhocal aip (Google "
"Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords), ní do "
"ghnáthphasfhocal."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 needs \"Authenticated SMTP\" enabled for the mailbox. "
"Microsoft is retiring password sign-in for SMTP; if login fails, use a relay"
" service such as Brevo or your host's SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn \"Authenticated SMTP\" cumasaithe don bhosca poist i Microsoft "
"365. Tá Microsoft ag scor síniú isteach le pasfhocal do SMTP; má theipeann "
"ar an logáil isteach, úsáid seirbhís sealaíochta mar Brevo nó SMTP "
"d’óstaigh."

msgid ""
"Username: the SMTP login shown under SMTP & API. Password: an SMTP key, not "
"your account password."
msgstr ""
"Ainm úsáideora: an logáil SMTP atá léirithe faoi SMTP & API. Pasfhocal: "
"eochair SMTP, ní do phasfhocal cuntais."

msgid "Username: the word \"apikey\". Password: your SendGrid API key."
msgstr "Ainm úsáideora: an focal \"apikey\". Pasfhocal: d’eochair API SendGrid."

msgid ""
"EU accounts use smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Username and password: the SMTP "
"credentials of your sending domain."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann cuntais AE smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Ainm úsáideora agus pasfhocal: "
"dintiúir SMTP do d’fhearann seolta."

msgid ""
"Change the region in the host to yours. Username and password: SMTP "
"credentials created in the SES console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh an réigiún san óstach go dtí do réigiún féin. Ainm úsáideora agus "
"pasfhocal: dintiúir SMTP cruthaithe i consól SES (ní do chuid eochracha "
"rochtana AWS)."

msgid "Username and password: both are your Server API token."
msgstr ""
"Ainm úsáideora agus pasfhocal: is é an Server API token atá iontu araon."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.zoho.com for accounts outside the EU. With two-factor sign-in, "
"create an app-specific password."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid smtp.zoho.com do chuntais lasmuigh den AE. Le síniú isteach dhá "
"fhachtóir, cruthaigh pasfhocal sonrach d’aip."

msgid "Username: API key. Password: secret key."
msgstr "Ainm úsáideora: eochair API. Pasfhocal: eochair rúnda."

msgid ""
"Username and password: an SMTP user created under Sending → SMTP Users."
msgstr ""
"Ainm úsáideora agus pasfhocal: úsáideoir SMTP cruthaithe faoi Sending → SMTP"
" Users."

msgid "Username: the full mailbox address. Password: the mailbox password."
msgstr ""
"Ainm úsáideora: seoladh iomlán an bhosca poist. Pasfhocal: pasfhocal an "
"bhosca poist."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.ionos.de or smtp.ionos.co.uk for those regions. Username: the full "
"mailbox address."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid smtp.ionos.de nó smtp.ionos.co.uk do na réigiúin sin. Ainm úsáideora: "
"seoladh iomlán an bhosca poist."

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"

msgid ""
"Sends all WordPress email through your own SMTP server, with a searchable "
"email log, resend, a backup connection, failure alerts and connection "
"diagnostics. No upsells."
msgstr ""
"Seolann sé gach ríomhphost WordPress trí do fhreastalaí SMTP féin, le log "
"ríomhphoist inchuardaithe, athsheoladh, nasc cúltaca, foláirimh faoi "
"theipeanna agus diagnóisic nasc. Gan aon uasdíol."

msgid "lynbro aps"
msgstr "lynbro aps"

msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid ""
"Host: the SMTP endpoint of your SES region, shown in the SES console under "
"SMTP settings. Username and password: SMTP credentials created in the SES "
"console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Óstach: críochphointe SMTP do réigiún SES, a thaispeántar sa chonsól SES "
"faoi shocruithe SMTP. Ainm úsáideora agus focal faire: dintiúir SMTP a "
"cruthaíodh sa chonsól SES (ní d’eochracha rochtana AWS)."

msgid "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"

msgid "LynBro ApS"
msgstr "LynBro ApS"

msgid ""
"Optional. A Slack or Discord incoming webhook, or your own HTTPS endpoint "
"(JSON with \"text\" and \"content\"). The plugin posts the error text there "
"— nothing else, and only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Roghnach. Imeallghreamh isteach Slack nó Discord, nó do chríochphointe HTTPS"
" féin (JSON le \"text\" agus \"content\"). Seolann an breiseán téacs na "
"hearráide ansin — faic eile, agus sin amháin nuair a shocraíonn tú URL."

msgid "Is %s doing its job?"
msgstr "An bhfuil %s ag déanamh a chuid oibre?"

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you, a short "
"review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it — honest ones, "
"critical ones included."
msgstr ""
"Tá tú á úsáid le cúpla seachtain anois. Má oibríonn sé duit, cabhraíonn "
"léirmheas gairid ar WordPress.org le húinéirí eile suíomhanna é a aimsiú — "
"fiú léirmheasanna macánta agus cáinteacha."

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you — or if "
"something is missing — tell us on our public roadmap. That is how we decide "
"what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Tá tú á úsáid le cúpla seachtain anois. Má oibríonn sé duit — nó má tá rud "
"éigin in easnamh — inis dúinn ar ár mbóthar poiblí. Sin mar a roghnaímid cad"
" a thógfaimid ina dhiaidh seo."

msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(osclaíonn i gcluaisín nua)"

msgid "Share feedback"
msgstr "Roinn aiseolas"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "B'fhéidir níos déanaí"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Ná fiafraigh arís"

msgid "Something not working? Ask for help"
msgstr "Rud éigin nach bhfuil ag obair? Iarr cabhair"

msgid "WooCommerce is active"
msgstr "Tá WooCommerce gníomhach"

msgid "a form plugin is active"
msgstr "Tá breiseán foirme gníomhach"

msgid "the site is set up for Denmark"
msgstr "Tá an suíomh socraithe do Dhánmhairg"

msgid "comments are open"
msgstr "Tá tuairimí oscailte"

msgid "tracking tags are active"
msgstr "Tá clibeanna rianaithe gníomhach"

msgid "visitors can create accounts"
msgstr "Is féidir le cuairteoirí cuntais a chruthú"

msgid "Suggested because %l."
msgstr "Moladh mar gheall ar %l."

msgid "Suggested for this site"
msgstr "Moladh don suíomh seo"

msgid "Hide suggestions"
msgstr "Folaigh moltaí"

msgid ""
"Other Lynbro plugins that fit what this site uses. Nothing is installed "
"unless you click."
msgstr ""
"Breiseáin Lynbro eile a oireann do úsáid an tsuímh seo. Ní shuiteáiltear aon"
" rud mura gcliceálann tú."

msgid "All Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Gach breiseán Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Picked from what this site already uses — read on this site, nothing is sent"
" anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaithe as an méid atá in úsáid cheana ar an suíomh seo — léite ar an "
"suíomh seo, ní sheoltar aon rud áit ar bith eile."

msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Optamaitheoir Íomhánna"

msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Tiontaigh go WebP agus AVIF, athraigh íomhánna ró-mhóra go méid ceart agus "
"luchtú mall — go léir ar do fhreastalaí féin."

msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "Stiúideo AI"

msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no"
" credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Scríobh agus maisigh poist le AI ag úsáid do eochair OpenAI féin — ar "
"chostas, gan aon chreidiúintí idir eatarthu."

msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Anailísíocht"

msgid ""
"Self-hosted, cookieless analytics with funnels. Visitor data never leaves "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Anailísíocht féin-óstáilte, gan fianáin, le tonnadóirí. Ní fhágann sonraí "
"cuairteoirí do bhunachar sonraí riamh."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Clibeanna"

msgid ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and more without code — each tag "
"waits for consent."
msgstr ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel agus níos mó gan cód — fanann gach "
"clib le toiliú."

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Foirmeacha"

msgid ""
"Forms with entries saved for free and no cap, conditional logic checked "
"server-side, and signed webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Foirmeacha le hiontrálacha sábháilte saor in aisce gan teorainn, le loighic "
"choinníollach ar an bhfreastalaí, agus gréasánchurtha sínithe."

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Fíoraigh"

msgid ""
"Catch mistyped e-mail domains and bad phone numbers, and confirm them with a"
" one-time code by e-mail or SMS."
msgstr ""
"Aimsigh seoltaí ríomhphoist mílitrithe agus uimhreacha gutháin míchearta, "
"agus deimhnigh iad le cód aonuaire trí ríomhphost nó SMS."

msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Taisce"

msgid ""
"Reliable purging for an nginx FastCGI cache and a Redis object cache, with "
"every purge verified against the cache itself."
msgstr ""
"Glanadh iontaofa do thaisce nginx FastCGI agus taisce réada Redis, le gach "
"glanadh fíoraithe i gcoinne an taisce féin."

msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Aistrigh"

msgid ""
"Run your site in several languages, with machine translation on your own "
"OpenAI key — nothing metered, nothing sold by the word."
msgstr ""
"Rith do shuíomh i roinnt teangacha, le haistriúchán meaisín ar do eochair "
"OpenAI féin — gan aon miosúr, gan aon rud á dhíol de réir focal."

msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Sciath"

msgid ""
"Security headers, HTTPS with HSTS, a small firewall against injection probes"
" and the hardening switches every site needs."
msgstr ""
"Ceanntásca slándála, HTTPS le HSTS, balla dóiteáin beag in aghaidh ionsaithe"
" insteallta agus na lasca cruaite atá ag teastáil ó gach suíomh."

msgid "Anti-Spam"
msgstr "Frith-Spam"

msgid ""
"Spam checks that run on your own server. No account, no subscription, every "
"block says why — and a held message is never lost."
msgstr ""
"Seiceálacha spam a ritheann ar do fhreastalaí féin. Gan cuntas, gan síntiús,"
" míníonn gach bac an fáth — agus ní chailltear teachtaireacht coinnithe "
"riamh."

msgid "Login Guard"
msgstr "Garda Logála Isteach"

msgid ""
"Move wp-login.php, limit failed sign-ins and add app-based two-factor — with"
" three ways back in."
msgstr ""
"Bog wp-login.php, teorainnigh logálacha isteach teipthe agus cuir dhá "
"fhachtóir bunaithe ar aip leis — le trí bhealach isteach ar ais."

msgid "Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Toiliú Fianán"

msgid ""
"A GDPR and ePrivacy banner with Consent Mode v2, an equally prominent Reject"
" button and 35 languages."
msgstr ""
"Meirge GDPR agus ePrivacy le Consent Mode v2, cnaipe Diúltaigh chomh "
"feiceálach céanna agus 35 teanga."

msgid "Activity Log"
msgstr "Log Gníomhaíochta"

msgid ""
"Who did what, when and from where — written down on your own server, "
"searchable, exportable, and deleted on your schedule."
msgstr ""
"Cé a rinne cad, cathain agus ó cá háit — scríofa ar do fhreastalaí féin, in-"
"innéanta, in-easpórtáilte, agus scriosta de réir do sceidil."

msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Coinneáil Sonraí"

msgid ""
"Find where personal data actually sits in your database, then delete it on a"
" schedule — with a dry run before every deletion."
msgstr ""
"Aimsigh cá bhfuil sonraí pearsanta i do bhunachar sonraí, ansin scrios de "
"réir sceidil — le rith tirim roimh gach scriosadh."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Inrochtaineacht"

msgid ""
"Scan every page against WCAG 2.2 AA and fix what can be fixed safely. No "
"overlay, no page limit."
msgstr ""
"Scan gach leathanach i gcoinne WCAG 2.2 AA agus ceartaigh a bhfuil sábháilte"
" a cheartú. Gan forleagan, gan teorainn leathanach."

msgid "SEO"
msgstr "Sinsearach"

msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"Sinsearach éadrom le scéimre LocalBusiness saor in aisce, léarscáileanna "
"suímh agus cártaí sóisialta. Ní sheoltar aon rud abhaile."

msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "Seoltóir SMTP"

msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhphost WordPress trí do fhreastalaí SMTP féin — le log ríomhphoist, "
"athsheoladh, nasc cúltaca agus foláirimh teipe."

msgid "Social Feed"
msgstr "Fotha Sóisialta"

msgid ""
"An Instagram feed on your site without a Meta token stored in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Fotha Instagram ar do shuíomh gan aon chomhartha Meta stóráilte i WordPress."

msgid "Reviews Cache"
msgstr "Taisce Léirmheasanna"

msgid "Show your Google reviews without putting an API key in WordPress."
msgstr "Taispeáin do léirmheasanna Google gan eochair API a chur i WordPress."

msgid "Links"
msgstr "Naisc"

msgid ""
"Find broken links and manage redirects on your own server, with the reason "
"for every verdict."
msgstr ""
"Aimsigh naisc bhriste agus bainistigh atreoruithe ar do fhreastalaí féin, "
"leis an gcúis le gach cinneadh."

msgid "Danadresse Autofill"
msgstr "Danadresse Autofill"

msgid ""
"Danish address autocomplete and validation for WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable and EDD."
msgstr ""
"Uathchomhlánú agus bailíochtú seoltaí Danmhairgeacha do WooCommerce, "
"WPForms, Gravity, Fluent, Formidable agus EDD."

msgid "Soge Lookup"
msgstr "Cuardach Soge"

msgid ""
"Look up Danish vehicles (DMR) and companies (CVR) by plate, VIN or CVR "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Cuardaigh feithiclí Danmhairgeacha (DMR) agus cuideachtaí (CVR) de réir "
"uimhir chláraithe, VIN nó CVR."

msgid "CVR Checkout"
msgstr "Seiceáil Amach CVR"

msgid ""
"Danish B2B checkout for WooCommerce: CVR company autofill, CVR/EU-VAT (VIES)"
" validation and an EAN/GLN field."
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil amach B2B Danmhairgeach do WooCommerce: uathlíonadh cuideachta CVR,"
" bailíochtú CVR/EU-VAT (VIES) agus réimse EAN/GLN."

msgid "Danish Shipping"
msgstr "Loingseoireacht Danmhairgeach"

msgid ""
"Free pickup point selection for PostNord and GLS Denmark at the WooCommerce "
"checkout, plus clean shipping methods."
msgstr ""
"Roghnú pointe bailithe saor in aisce do PostNord agus GLS Denmark ag "
"seiceáil amach WooCommerce, móide modhanna loingseoireachta glana."

msgid "API Auth"
msgstr "Údarú API"

msgid ""
"JSON Web Tokens for the REST API that you can actually revoke, with scopes "
"and a journal of refusals."
msgstr ""
"JSON Web Tokens don REST API is féidir leat a chur ar ceal, le scóip agus "
"dialann diúltaithe."

msgid "Failure alerts by email do not get out"
msgstr "Ní sheoltar foláirimh teipe trí ríomhphost"

msgid ""
"The alert email is sent with PHP mail() so that it does not depend on the "
"SMTP server, but PHP mail() failed on this server: %s Use a webhook for "
"alerts, or ask your host to enable mail()."
msgstr ""
"Seoltar an ríomhphost foláirimh le PHP mail() ionas nach mbeidh sé ag brath "
"ar an bhfreastalaí SMTP, ach theip ar PHP mail() ar an bhfreastalaí seo: %s "
"Úsáid webhook le haghaidh foláirimh, nó iarr ar do óstálaí mail() a chumasú."

msgid ""
"This is the previous version of Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer has replaced"
" it and uses the same settings. Remove the folder %s with your host's file "
"manager, FTP or SSH — do not use Delete here: its uninstall erases the "
"shared SMTP settings. Lynbro SMTP Mailer keeps a backup and puts them back, "
"but the old plugin also empties the email log."
msgstr ""
"Seo an leagan roimhe seo de Lynbro SMTP. Tháinig Lynbro SMTP Mailer ina áit "
"agus úsáideann sé na socruithe céanna. Bain an fillteán %s le bainisteoir "
"comhad d’óstach, FTP nó SSH — ná húsáid an rogha Scrios anseo: scriosann an "
"díshuiteáil seo na socruithe SMTP comhroinnte. Coinníonn Lynbro SMTP Mailer "
"cúltaca agus cuireann sé na socruithe ar ais, ach glanann an seanbhreiseán "
"logáil na ríomhphost freisin."

msgid ""
"Your SMTP settings were deleted by another plugin on %s and have been "
"restored from the backup. Nothing for you to do; send a test email if you "
"want to be sure."
msgstr ""
"Scrios breiseán eile do shocruithe SMTP ar %s agus cuireadh ar ais iad ón "
"gcúltaca. Níl aon rud le déanamh agat; seol ríomhphost tástála más mian leat"
" a bheith cinnte."

msgid ""
"This site sends with the server's own mail (PHP mail()). The test shows "
"whether the server accepted the email; check its headers in the inbox "
"(Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."
msgstr ""
"Seolann an suíomh seo ríomhphost trí chóras ríomhphoist an fhreastalaí féin "
"(PHP mail()). Léiríonn an tástáil ar ghlac an freastalaí leis an ríomhphost;"
" seiceáil a cheanntásca sa bhosca isteach (Authentication-Results: spf=pass,"
" dmarc=pass)."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes this web server (its IP address with ip4: or ip6:, or "
"a: / mx: that resolves to it)."
msgstr ""
"Cinntigh go n-áirítear an freastalaí gréasáin seo ann (a sheoladh IP le ip4:"
" nó ip6:, nó a: / mx: a réitíonn chuig é)."

msgid ""
"Email is sent with this server's own mail (PHP mail()), from %s, with a "
"matching Return-Path."
msgstr ""
"Seoltar an ríomhphost trí chóras ríomhphoist an fhreastalaí seo féin (PHP "
"mail()), ó %s, agus Return-Path comhoiriúnach leis."

msgid ""
"Return-Path is off: the server puts its own address on the envelope, so SPF "
"checks that domain instead of yours."
msgstr ""
"Tá Return-Path múchta: cuireann an freastalaí a sheoladh féin ar an "
"gclúdach, agus mar sin seiceálann SPF an fearann sin seachas do cheannsa."

msgid "Email is sent with the server's own mail, with a matching sender"
msgstr ""
"Seoltar an ríomhphost trí chóras ríomhphoist an fhreastalaí féin, agus tá an"
" seoltóir comhoiriúnach leis."

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends with PHP mail() by your choice and sets the From address "
"and Return-Path on every email. Keep this server in the domain's SPF record."
msgstr ""
"Seolann Lynbro SMTP trí PHP mail() de réir do rogha féin agus socraíonn sé "
"an seoladh From agus Return-Path ar gach ríomhphost. Coinnigh an freastalaí "
"seo i dtaifead SPF an fhearainn."

msgid "This server's own mail (PHP mail(), no SMTP)"
msgstr "Córas ríomhphoist an fhreastalaí féin (PHP mail(), gan SMTP)"

msgid ""
"For servers that are set up to send mail themselves. No login needed: the "
"From address and the Return-Path below are still set on every email, so SPF "
"and DMARC can line up. The domain's SPF record must include this server."
msgstr ""
"Do fhreastalaithe atá cumraithe chun ríomhphost a sheoladh iad féin. Níl "
"logáil isteach ag teastáil: socraítear an seoladh From agus Return-Path "
"thíos ar gach ríomhphost fós, ionas gur féidir le SPF agus DMARC teacht le "
"chéile. Ní mór an freastalaí seo a áireamh i dtaifead SPF an fhearainn."
